[PrintTextModified Text:"（大家都在考虑各种可能性……！<br>　但是……实际到底发生了什么呢……）|#0103Trial10_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR1_2,ArmL5,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Surprised_Open2
@GosubToSplitPerspectiveStageScreens Index:1 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:……艾玛小姐，<br>我们至今进行了各种讨论和验证。|#0103Trial10_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR1_2,ArmL5,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Surprised_Open2
[PrintTextModified Text:可是……我认为我们并没有找到证据<br>证明存在不自然的机关。|#0103Trial10_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……你说得对。<br>那大家提出的这些可能性，其实根本就——|#0103Trial10_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR5_1,ArmL4,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open2

[PrintTextModified Text:——那么，会不会存在<br>【并非不自然的机关】呢？|#0103Trial10_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:并非不自然的机关……？|#0103Trial10_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR9_2,ArmL9,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Smile_Closed1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。这个机关本身可能没什么特别之处，<br>但在这起案件中却能发挥关键作用……<br>就是这样子的机关。|#0103Trial10_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Nervous_Closed
@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:（这样的机关……真的存在吗……）|#0103Trial10_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Nervous_Closed
[PrintTextModified Text:"（但是……一定会有些蛛丝马迹……！<br>　我要去相信……相信大家的话！！）|#0103Trial10_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

